#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid "&amp;nbsp;<br/>"
msgstr "&amp;nbsp;<br/>"

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&amp;nbsp;For larger projects, we offer comprehensive services that include "
"<b>on-site installation</b> and meticulous project management, ensuring a "
"smooth and successful completion from start to finish."
msgstr ""
"&amp;nbsp;Za večje projekte ponujamo celovite storitve, ki vključujejo <b>"
"namestitev na lokaciji</b> in skrbno vodenje projekta ter zagotavljajo "
"nemoten in uspešen zaključek od začetka do konca."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&amp;nbsp;Our expertise extends across diverse industries. We provide custom "
"metal fabrication services for both <b>individuals</b> and <b>businesses</b> "
"in sectors like <b>agriculture</b>, <b>automotive</b>, and "
"<b>pharmaceuticals</b>, ensuring we meet the unique demands of each project."
msgstr ""
"&amp;nbsp;Naše strokovno znanje sega čez različne panoge. Nudimo storitve "
"izdelave kovinskih konstrukcij po meri tako <b>posameznikom</b> kot <b>"
"podjetjem</b> v sektorjih, kot so <b>kmetijstvo</b>, <b>avtomobilska "
"industrija</b> in <b>farmacija</b>, pri čemer zagotavljamo, da izpolnimo "
"edinstvene zahteve vsakega projekta."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<a class=\"btn btn-secondary mb-2 o_translate_inline\" href=\"/"
"contactus\">Get your project started</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"btn btn-secondary mb-2 o_translate_inline\" href=\"/contactus\">"
"Začnite svoj projekt</a>"

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Accounting:</b> Automatically log payments, close sessions, and generate "
"tax reports."
msgstr ""
"<b>Računovodstvo:</b> Samodejno beleži plačila, zapira seje in ustvarja "
"davčna poročila."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Adjust the expected arrival date</b> as needed."
msgstr "<b>Po potrebi prilagodite pričakovani datum prihoda</b>."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Buy:</b> Select this if the product is purchased from a vendor."
msgstr "<b>Nakup:</b> To izberite, če je izdelek kupljen od dobavitelja."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Combine RFQs:</b> If you have multiple requests for quotation (RFQs) from "
"the same vendor, you can group them into a single order."
msgstr ""
"<b>Združevanje zahtev za ponudbo:</b> Če imate več zahtev za ponudbo (RFQ) "
"istega dobavitelja, jih lahko združite v eno samo naročilo."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Create a purchase order</b> and add the products and services you need."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ustvarite nabavno naročilo</b> in dodajte izdelke ter storitve, ki jih "
"potrebujete."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Field Service:</b> Plan and monitor on-site installations."
msgstr ""
"<b>Terenske storitve:</b> Načrtujte in spremljajte namestitve na lokaciji."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory Tracking:</b> In this database, we've decided not to track "
"products using a Warehouse Management System, even though Odoo offers this "
"feature. While inventory tracking improves stock accuracy and forecasting, "
"it also requires more administrative tasks to ensure all operations are "
"validated on time. If you wish to implement inventory tracking, you can find "
"more information in the official documentation."
msgstr ""
"<b>Sledenje zalogi:</b> V tej podatkovni zbirki smo se odločili, da izdelkov "
"ne bomo sledili z uporabo sistema za upravljanje skladišča, čeprav Odoo "
"ponuja to funkcionalnost. Čeprav sledenje zalogi izboljša natančnost zalog "
"in napovedovanje, zahteva tudi več administrativnih opravil, da se zagotovi "
"pravočasna potrditev vseh operacij. Če želite uvesti sledenje zalogi, lahko "
"več informacij najdete v uradni dokumentaciji."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory:</b> Track and manage all your products within a custom-"
"designed warehouse."
msgstr ""
"<b>Zaloga:</b> Spremljajte in upravljajte vse svoje izdelke v skladišču, "
"zasnovanem po meri."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Manufacture:</b> Choose this if the product is made in-house."
msgstr ""
"<b>Proizvodnja:</b> Izberite to možnost, če je izdelek izdelan v lastni "
"proizvodnji."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Open the Manufacturing Order</b> and add the necessary components."
msgstr "<b>Odprite proizvodni nalog</b> in dodajte potrebne komponente."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Production Guidance:</b> If you have employees on the shop floor who need "
"guidance on manufacturing processes, consider exploring the <b>Work Order</"
"b> feature and <b>Shopfloor</b> application. They are designed to provide "
"operational support and instructions for your team. See documentation about "
"it if you want to implement."
msgstr ""
"<b>Smernice za proizvodnjo:</b> Če imate zaposlene v proizvodnji, ki "
"potrebujejo navodila o proizvodnih procesih, razmislite o uporabi funkcije "
"<b>Delovni nalog</b> in aplikacije <b>Shopfloor</b>. Zasnovani sta tako, da "
"vaši ekipi zagotavljata operativno podporo in navodila. Če ju želite uvesti, "
"si oglejte dokumentacijo."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Setting up the Purchase App</b>"
msgstr "<b>Nastavitev aplikacije Nabava</b>"

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<b>Validate the order</b> to confirm it."
msgstr "<b>Preverite naročilo</b>, da ga potrdite."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>CRM &amp; Sales App</b>:</font> Manage all "
"product and service charges for your clients, creating detailed quotations "
"for bespoke items."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Aplikacija CRM in prodaja</b>:</font> "
"Upravljajte vse stroške izdelkov in storitev za svoje stranke ter "
"ustvarjajte podrobne ponudbe za izdelke po meri."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Inventory App</b>:</font> Keep strict "
"control over your raw metals, hardware, and finished components across your "
"warehouse and production floor."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Aplikacija Inventar</b>:</font> Ohranite "
"strog nadzor nad svojimi surovimi kovinami, okovjem in končnimi komponentami "
"v skladišču in proizvodnem obratu."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Invoicing App</b>:</font> Keep track of "
"all your invoices, handling progress billing for long-term projects or "
"standard invoicing for direct sales."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Aplikacija za izdajanje računov</b>:</"
"font> Spremljajte vse svoje račune ter upravljajte obračunavanje po napredku "
"pri dolgoročnih projektih ali standardno izdajanje računov pri neposredni "
"prodaji."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Manufacturing App</b>:</font> Handle the "
"creation of all your products, managing bills of materials (BoMs) and work "
"centers for everything from cutting to welding."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Aplikacija Proizvodnja</b>:</font> "
"Upravljajte ustvarjanje vseh svojih izdelkov, kosovnice (BoM) in delovne "
"centre za vse, od rezanja do varjenja."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Project App</b>:</font> Manage complex "
"fabrication projects that involve multiple production stages and "
"installation phases efficiently."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Aplikacija Projekti</b>:</font> Učinkovito "
"upravljajte kompleksne projekte izdelave, ki vključujejo več proizvodnih "
"stopenj in faz namestitve."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Purchase App</b>:</font> Ensure accurate "
"inventory replenishment for raw materials and track <b>subcontracting "
"services</b> for specialized treatments like galvanizing."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Nabavna aplikacija</b>:</font> Zagotovite "
"natančno dopolnjevanje zalog surovin in spremljajte <b>podizvajalske "
"storitve</b> za specializirane obdelave, kot je galvanizacija."

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Website App</b>:</font> Act as a virtual "
"showroom to display your past projects and specialized capabilities, serving "
"as a powerful tool for generating new leads."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Aplikacija spletnega mesta</b>:</font> "
"Delujte kot virtualni razstavni prostor za predstavitev preteklih projektov "
"in specializiranih zmogljivosti ter služite kot učinkovito orodje za "
"pridobivanje novih potencialnih strank."

