msgid ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">This module is designed to streamline your daily "
"production, from start to finish. It helps you manage customer "
"relationships, prepare for production, purchase raw materials, and handle "
"deliveries. With this complete solution, you can boost efficiency and "
"improve customer satisfaction across all your production services.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">Ta modul je zasnovan za poenostavitev vaše vsakodnevne "
"proizvodnje od začetka do konca. Pomaga vam upravljati odnose s strankami, "
"se pripraviti na proizvodnjo, nabaviti surovine in obravnavati dostave. S to "
"celovito rešitvijo lahko povečate učinkovitost in izboljšate zadovoljstvo "
"strank pri vseh svojih proizvodnih storitvah.</span>"

